---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout title="Cookie Policy" updated="August 14, 2026">
  <p>
    Cookies are small text files a website can store on your device. Here's
    exactly what mybirdhouse.ca uses and why.
  </p>

  <h2>Essential cookies (always on)</h2>
  <p>
    Our site is hosted and protected by <strong>Cloudflare</strong>, which
    may set a small number of strictly necessary cookies (for example,
    <code>__cf_bm</code> or <code>cf_clearance</code>) to distinguish real
    visitors from bots and keep the site secure and available. These aren't
    used to track you across other sites, and the site can't function
    reliably without them, so they aren't optional.
  </p>

  <h2>Local storage for your cookie choice</h2>
  <p>
    When you dismiss the cookie banner on this site, we save that choice in
    your browser's local storage so we don't ask again. This stays on your
    device and isn't sent to us.
  </p>

  <h2>What we don't use</h2>
  <p>
    We don't use advertising cookies, third-party tracking pixels, or
    cross-site analytics cookies. We don't sell data to ad networks.
  </p>

  <h2>Controlling cookies</h2>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies through your browser's settings at any
    time. Because our only cookies are essential to site security, blocking
    them may affect how reliably the site loads.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
